---
import CarouselComponent from "./Carousel.Component"
---
<div class="bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] w-screen h-screen flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 items-center">
   <div class=" mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 mb-5">
        <h2 class="text-4xl text-center font-bold mb-5">Skills</h2>
            <p class="text-lg">
          What really drives me is
          collaboration and empathy. I bring Lean Six Sigma principles to every
          project to keep our processes lean and customer-focused, and I’m happiest
          when I’m mentoring teammates on TDD best practices or brainstorming ways
          to make the web more accessible for everyone. When I’m not debugging
          pipelines or fine-tuning microservices, you’ll find me exploring Atlanta’s
          coffee scene, sketching UI ideas for side projects, or diving into the
          latest accessibility guidelines to ensure every experience feels
          welcoming.
        </p>
   </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px]">
        <CarouselComponent client:load />
    </div>
</div>